{
  "metadata": {
    "description": "Heating and cooling setpoints and setback deltas by all-level space type, used to build thermostat schedules around a model own hours of operation.",
    "derived_from": "prototypes/common/data/thermostat_schedule_lookup.json and the standards schedule data",
    "units": "degrees Celsius",
    "notes": [
      "A setback delta of 0 means the space type holds its setpoint around the clock.",
      "A space type found under several building types takes the setpoints of the building type it is most commonly found in.",
      "Building-type-qualified space types inherit their base type when the lookup has no entry of their own.",
      "A model needing different setpoints for a space type states them in the thermostat_overrides section of its specification."
    ]
  },
